Answer the reader's consequential question from these authoritative units only. State the actual actor, permitted/required/prohibited action, applicable conditions and unresolved ambiguity. Cite the operative unit IDs. Preserve the difference between an exception and a general rule, and between a permission and an obligation. Do not see or reconstruct the simplified draft.
